1. Identification of the substance/mixture and of the company
Safety Data Sheet Hexamethylene diisocyanate, technical grade
Product: Hexamethylendiisocyanat, techn.
SDS: SDB-11207-DE
2. Hazards identification
H: H315 H317 H319 H330 H334 H335
3. Composition / information on ingredients
Hexamethylene
diisocyanate
822-06-0 212-485-8 99–100 % H315 H317 H319
H330 H334 H335
4. First-aid measures
After skin contact wash with soap and water. After eye contact rinse with water for several minutes.
Seek medical advice if symptoms persist.
5. Firefighting measures
Suitable extinguishing media: foam, dry powder, carbon dioxide, water spray. Wear self-contained
breathing apparatus.
6. Accidental release measures
Wear personal protective equipment, remove ignition sources, absorb with inert material and dispose of
properly. Do not let product enter drains.
7. Handling and storage
Keep container tightly closed in a well-ventilated place, away from ignition sources and incompatible
materials.
8. Exposure controls / personal protection
Use protective gloves, safety goggles and, if needed, respiratory protection. Provide adequate local
exhaust ventilation.
9. Physical and chemical properties
Density: 1.05
Base unit: KG
Shelf life (months): 12
10. Stability and reactivity
Stable under normal conditions of use and storage. Avoid strong oxidisers, acids and bases.

11. Toxicological information
Information is based on the components listed in section 3 and the classification of the mixture.
12. Ecological information
Do not allow to enter waterways or soil. Observe aquatic hazard classification.
13. Disposal considerations
Dispose of in accordance with local regulations through a licensed waste contractor. Hand in empty
containers fully drained.
14. Transport information
UN: UN2281
ADR/IMDG class: 6.1
Packing group: II
HS: 29291000
15. Regulatory information
Classification and labelling under Regulation (EC) No 1272/2008 (CLP), REACH (EC) 1907/2006, US TSCA
and OSHA HazCom 2012 where applicable.
Hexamethylene diisocyanate: IECSC – nicht erforderlich
Hexamethylene diisocyanate: REACH – nicht erforderlich
Hexamethylene diisocyanate: TSCA – nicht erforderlich
16. Other information
7.1 · 2023-05-11');
