1. Identification of the substance/mixture and of the company
Safety Data Sheet Marencoat HL 509 water-based wood coating
Product: Marencoat HL 509 Holzlack (wasserbasiert)
SDS: SDB-10807-DE
2. Hazards identification
H: H302 H312 H315 H317 H318 H319 H332 H400
3. Composition / information on ingredients
Water (demineralised) 7732-18-5 231-791-2 39.2–47.9 %
Styrene-acrylate
copolymer dispersion
25767-47-9 38.4–47 %
Titanium dioxide 13463-67-7 236-675-5 8.2–10 %
2-Butoxyethanol 111-76-2 203-905-0 2.8–3.8 % H302 H312
H315 H319
H332
Paraffin wax 8002-74-2 232-315-6 0.475–1.425 %
