INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('6c110534-6e02-4ddb-860d-f9a3011c7d78', 'DMS-00000556_CRM-20250108-0001.txt', 'text/plain', '974', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:15:48.773214', 'From: bernd.albrecht@marenthal-chemie.de
To: panagiotis.konstantinou@dimitriou-water.gr
Cc: 
Date: 2025-01-08T16:30:00
Subject: Regulatory status Marenemul 731 emulsifier

Dear Mr Konstantinou,

Thank you for your patience regarding your query on the regulatory status of Marenemul 731 emulsifier. I can confirm that our Product Stewardship department is finalising the written statement covering its REACH registration status, and you will receive this directly from them within the next few business days.

In the meantime, could you let us know whether the intended application remains the water treatment formulation for municipal systems we discussed previously? This will help us ensure the documentation addresses your specific use case and any relevant regional requirements for Greece.

Should you need the statement urgently for an upcoming tender submission, please let me know and I will follow up with my colleagues to expedite it.

Kind regards
Bernd Albrecht
');
