Subject: Documents Hydrochloric acid (33 %), technical grade

Dear Ms Ortiz,

Thank you for your recent inquiry. Please find attached the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for Hydrochloric acid (33 %), technical grade.

As discussed, this grade is typically supplied in 1,000-litre IBCs, and standard lead time from our Marenthal site is approximately 7–10 business days from order confirmation. Should you require delivery in smaller drums instead, please let us know and we will gladly adjust the packaging on the quotation.

