INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('e77b46b4-7b6c-4305-b84e-14df120ccbfd', 'DMS-00000576_CRM-20250121-0006.txt', 'text/plain', '883', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:16:10.956585', 'From: petra.stoll@marenthal-chemie.de
To: justyna.kowalska@zawadzki-obrobka.pl
Cc: 
Date: 2025-01-21T09:17:00
Subject: Sample request Sulfuric acid (96 %), technical grade

Dear Ms Kowalska,

Thank you for your sample request. We are pleased to confirm that the requested samples of Sulfuric acid (96 %), technical grade, totaling 20 kg, will be dispatched to your facility this week. The shipment will be packed in two 10 kg HDPE containers, and the safety data sheet will accompany the goods so that your team can review handling and storage requirements before use.

Should you need any further technical information on the grade or its suitability for your surface treatment processes, please do not hesitate to let us know. We would also welcome a short note on the intended application so that we can advise you on the most appropriate specification.

Kind regards
Petra Stoll
');
