INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('1409ab75-423a-4605-9249-cc7e244479ee', 'DMS-00000602_CRM-20250205-0009.txt', 'text/plain', '933', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:16:38.005892', 'From: yingli.zhang@marenthal-chemicals.cn
To: h.li@ruifeng-coatings.com.cn
Cc: 
Date: 2025-02-05T11:39:00
Subject: 二氧化钛（工业级） 应用技术支持

李慧您好，

感谢您近日的来电垻续沟通。根据我们上周讨论的内容，现附上二氧化钛（工业级）产品在涂料配方中的添加比例建议及应用技术说明文档，请查阅附件。

建议添加比例为总配方的8%-12%，具体可根据贵司涂料体系的遮盖力及光泽度要求进行调整。若贵司计划近期开展前期配方试验，我们可提供25公斤/袋的标准包装样品，交期约为5个工作日，供试验阶段使用。

此外，想请教一下，贵司此次试验主要针对哪种基材（如金属或塑料）？以便我们提供更具针对性的技术建议。

我们非常乐意全程支持贵司的试验工作，如有任何疑问，请随时与我联系。

此致
敬礼
张颖莉
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('d0f515d9-8913-4945-a1fb-3102e96ee730', 'DMS-00000603_CRM-20250205-0010.txt', 'text/plain', '931', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:16:38.92065', 'From: michel.mercier@marenthal.fr
To: bruno.melo@santos-componentes.com.br
Cc: 
Date: 2025-02-05T11:56:00
Subject: Quality alignment Marensolv 302 degreasing spirit (solvent blend)

Dear Mr Melo,

Thank you for taking the time to discuss the quality requirements for Marensolv 302 degreasing spirit (solvent blend) during our call yesterday. We are pleased to confirm that the specification we agreed upon will be fixed for all upcoming deliveries to Santos Componentes automóveis Ltda. Each shipment, beginning with your next order of 4,000 litres in 200-litre drums, will be accompanied by a batch certificate confirming compliance with the agreed parameters.

Could you also let us know whether the product will continue to be used for the same degreasing application on your production line, or if conditions have changed? This would help us ensure the blend remains fully suited to your process.

Kind regards
Michel Mercier
');
