INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('456ef8aa-a2a6-41ac-9b24-688c2057c21f', 'DMS-00000627_CRM-20250214-0014.txt', 'text/plain', '817', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:17:02.457596', 'From: thierry.brunet@marenthal.fr
To: radu.ionescu@mocanu-building.ro
Cc: 
Date: 2025-02-14T08:19:00
Subject: Sample request Marencoat AL 603 alkyd enamel

Dear Mr Ionescu,

Thank you for your recent request for samples of Marencoat AL 603 alkyd enamel. We are pleased to confirm that a 20 kg sample will be dispatched to you this week. It will be packed in a sealed 20 kg container with a batch label, and the safety data sheet will be sent along with it so that your team can review handling and storage requirements before use.

Once you have had a chance to test the product on your substrates, please let us know whether the drying time and finish meet your expectations for the planned application. We would also be glad to discuss any further technical details your team may need.

Kind regards
Thierry Brunet
');
