INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('cc90b513-9451-4038-b98e-68ebd59ba239', 'DMS-00000692_CRM-20250317-0023.txt', 'text/plain', '783', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:18:00.41089', 'From: sven.richter@marenthal-chemie.de
To: jaroslav.svoboda@bohemia-paints.cz
Cc: 
Date: 2025-03-17T08:44:00
Subject: Documents Ethanol, technical grade

Dear Mr Svoboda,

Thank you for your recent enquiry regarding Ethanol, technical grade. Please find attached the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for this product. The safety data sheet contains the hazard classification, handling and storage guidance, and first-aid measures, while the technical data sheet sets out the typical specification and packaging options for your planning.

Should your team need the documents in any other format, or if you have questions on the application for your paint formulations, please let me know and I will be glad to assist.

Kind regards
Sven Richter
');
