INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('209f89a7-59c1-402d-bfe1-f6c2833dca39', 'DMS-00000786_CRM-20250425-0033.txt', 'text/plain', '784', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:19:29.97458', 'From: sven.richter@marenthal-chemie.de
To: jaroslav.svoboda@bohemia-paints.cz
Cc: 
Date: 2025-04-25T08:01:00
Subject: Sample request Marencoat AL 634 alkyd enamel

Dear Mr Svoboda,

Thank you for your recent sample request. We are pleased to confirm that the samples of Marencoat AL 634 alkyd enamel, in 25 kg quantities, will be dispatched to your office this week. The safety data sheet will be sent along with the shipment so that your technical team has all the handling and storage information it needs before testing begins. The samples will be packed in sealed containers to preserve product quality during transit. Should you have any questions about the application properties or the test conditions, please do not hesitate to contact me directly.

Kind regards
Sven Richter
');
