INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('a48308d4-5659-4d6c-a2e6-d356d4d2c4a8', 'DMS-00000793_CRM-20250429-0034.txt', 'text/plain', '865', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:19:35.688196', 'From: adrian.castro@marenthal.fr
To: veronica.iglesias@mora-comercio.es
Cc: 
Date: 2025-04-29T12:04:00
Subject: Regulatory status Marenclean M 1200 machine cleaner (powder)

Dear Ms Iglesias,

Thank you for your recent enquiry about Marenclean M 1200 machine cleaner (powder). Our product stewardship team is currently finalising the written statement on the registration status of this product, and you can expect to receive it shortly. The team is confirming the current regulatory position for the powder formulation in the Spanish and EU markets, including the status of the relevant registrations, so that you have an accurate basis for your planning. Should you have any questions in the meantime, or require particular details for your own compliance file, please do not hesitate to let me know and I will pass them on directly.

Kind regards
Adrián Castro
');
