INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('ebabbf8e-c0c9-4b2b-88dc-14fd2a5ed256', 'DMS-00000799_CRM-20250430-0037.txt', 'text/plain', '857', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:19:40.844457', 'From: andres.rubio@marenthal.fr
To: miguel.rodrigues@lima-tratamento.com.br
Cc: 
Date: 2025-04-30T15:29:00
Subject: Sample request Toluene, technical grade

Dear Mr Rodrigues,

Thank you for your interest in our products. I am pleased to confirm that the requested sample of Toluene, technical grade (50 kg), will be dispatched to you this week. The material will be supplied in a standard steel drum to ensure safe transport and will be accompanied by the corresponding safety data sheet for your records.

Could you also let us know the intended application at your facility? This will help us ensure the product meets your specific process requirements and allow us to recommend the most suitable packaging for any future orders.

We look forward to your feedback once the sample has been tested.

Kind regards
Andrés Rubio
Marenthal Spezialchemie GmbH
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('57469918-61be-42f5-9546-cf337d3969e1', 'DMS-00000800_CRM-20250430-0038.txt', 'text/plain', '816', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:19:41.684329', 'From: christian.klein@marenthal-chemie.de
To: ivanka.stoyanova@balkan-surface.bg
Cc: 
Date: 2025-04-30T17:35:00
Subject: Offer follow-up Butyl acetate, technical grade

Dear Ms Stoyanova,

I hope this message finds you well. I would like to briefly follow up on the offer we sent for Butyl acetate, technical grade, and check whether any questions have come up on your end in the meantime.

As a reminder, the quoted lead time is approximately two weeks from order confirmation, with delivery available in 200 kg steel drums or, alternatively, in IBCs if that suits your logistics better. Please let me know if you would like us to adjust packaging or quantities to match your current production schedule in Burgas.

I am happy to arrange a short call if that would be more convenient.

Kind regards
Christian Klein
');
