INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('d471c247-9e16-4273-a81c-dcff205c2ee0', 'DMS-00000836_CRM-20250516-0042.txt', 'text/plain', '878', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:20:15.613422', 'From: thierry.brunet@marenthal.fr
To: e.stan@mocanu-building.ro
Cc: 
Date: 2025-05-16T08:14:00
Subject: Quality alignment Xylene (isomer mixture), technical grade

Dear Ms Stan,

Thank you for your recent discussion with our team. I am pleased to confirm that we have aligned on the agreed specification for Xylene (isomer mixture), technical grade, for your supply to Mocanu & Preda Building Products S.R.L. Every delivery will be accompanied by a batch certificate, so your quality team can verify each lot against the agreed parameters before it enters production. The material will continue to be shipped in the standard drums we discussed, and we will keep you informed of any change to lead times. Should your application team have further questions on the isomer ratio or handling requirements, please do not hesitate to contact me directly.

Kind regards
Thierry Brunet
');
