Dear Ms Ostrowska,

Thank you for your interest in Marensolv 302 degreasing spirit (solvent blend). I am pleased to confirm that the requested sample quantity of 10 kg will be dispatched to Pomorska Włókiennictwo Sp. z o.o. this week, packed in a sealed metal canister to ensure safe transport. The corresponding safety data sheet will accompany the shipment.

