INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('dd72080b-aadb-4066-a178-421a4b0dd478', 'DMS-00000863_CRM-20250528-0048.txt', 'text/plain', '900', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:20:42.481202', 'From: derek.hernandez@marenthal-chemicals.com
To: karen.kelley@hunter-machinery.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-05-28T10:48:00
Subject: Quality alignment Marenclean R 1402 rust remover

Dear Ms Kelley,

Thank you for your recent discussions with our team. I am pleased to confirm that we have now finalised the agreed specification for Marenclean R 1402 rust remover, and we have recorded it on our side for all upcoming orders.

As requested, a batch certificate will accompany every delivery, so your quality team can trace each lot back to its production data. Shipments will continue to be supplied in the 200-litre drums you specified, and we will notify you in advance of any change to the scheduled dispatch dates.

Should you have any questions about the application or require further technical information before the next call-off, please do not hesitate to get in touch.

Kind regards
Derek Hernandez
');
