INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('351d95f9-7554-4330-a457-d999953d250f', 'DMS-00000873_CRM-20250604-0049.txt', 'text/plain', '720', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:20:54.747902', 'From: michel.boucher@marenthal.fr
To: daniel.fuchs@schwabenbeschichtungen.de
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-04T10:01:00
Subject: Anwendungsberatung Marencoat HL 509 Holzlack (wasserbasiert)

Guten Tag Herr Fuchs,

wie besprochen erhalten Sie anbei die Dosierempfehlung für Marencoat HL 509 Holzlack (wasserbasiert). Das Dokument fasst die empfohlenen Mischungsverhältnisse und Auftragsmengen für Ihren Vorversuch zusammen.

Sehr gern unterstützen wir Sie bei der Durchführung. Bitte teilen Sie uns mit, auf welchem Untergrund Sie den Lack testen möchten, damit wir die Hinweise gezielt auf Ihre Anwendung abstimmen können.

Für Rückfragen stehe ich Ihnen jederzeit zur Verfügung.

Mit freundlichen Grüßen
Michel Boucher
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('3627ff8f-73c5-4442-bc9c-c166a4c656aa', 'DMS-00000874_CRM-20250604-0050.txt', 'text/plain', '810', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:20:55.626335', 'From: sofia.lane@marenthal-chemicals.com
To: william.perry@southeastern-water.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-04T13:07:00
Subject: Sample request Marenfoam 133 defoamer

Dear Mr Perry,

Thank you for your interest in Marenfoam 133 defoamer. I am pleased to confirm that your requested sample (5 kg) will be dispatched this week in a sealed HDPE container to ensure safe handling during transit, with an estimated delivery time of three to five business days via standard freight.

Along with the sample, you will receive the corresponding safety data sheet for your records and internal review.

Should you need any guidance on dosage rates or application within your specific water treatment process, please do not hesitate to reach out. We are happy to support you in optimizing performance.

Kind regards
Sofia Lane
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('ace6eff9-fd10-455b-a7d3-be8bac6a6869', 'DMS-00000875_CRM-20250604-0051.txt', 'text/plain', '758', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:20:57.902834', 'From: melanie.rolland@marenthal.fr
To: erik.boer@smit-environnement.be
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-04T13:35:00
Subject: Customer visit Smit Environnement

Dear Mr Boer,

Thank you for the warm welcome during my visit to Smit Environnement last week. It was very helpful to see your production site and to discuss your current requirements in more detail.

As agreed, I am following up on the open points regarding Propylene glycol, technical grade. Could you please confirm whether the product should be supplied in 1,000-litre IBCs or in bulk via tanker, as this will affect the delivery lead time from our Marenthal site? Once we have this information, we can finalise the proposal for the next order.

Looking forward to your reply.

Kind regards
Mélanie Rolland
');
