INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('1a76f5fd-1168-4305-8058-34605d19b71e', 'DMS-00000888_CRM-20250612-0053.txt', 'text/plain', '868', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:21:10.014463', 'From: yann.lefebvre@marenthal.fr
To: c.njoroge@kariuki-chemical.co.ke
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-12T11:21:00
Subject: Price adjustment Marenclean C 1305 CIP cleaner

Dear Mr Njoroge,

Please find attached our revised price offer for Marenclean C 1305 CIP cleaner, which now includes volume tiers starting at 20 t. The adjustment reflects recent changes in raw material costs, and the tiered structure should give your team more room to plan larger orders. Standard packaging remains 1,000 kg IBC containers, and we can confirm availability for delivery within two weeks of order confirmation. Should you wish to discuss the application in your CIP lines or the dosing ratios that suit your current setup, I would be glad to arrange a short call with our technical colleagues. We would appreciate your feedback on the offer by the end of the month.

Kind regards
Yann Lefebvre
