INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('e28a4ba2-6ab3-4634-b41d-8ee0b2771096', 'DMS-00000905_CRM-20250618-0054.txt', 'text/plain', '688', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:21:25.233471', 'From: marie.millet@marenthal.fr
To: antonio.coelho@minhota-materiais.pt
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-18T13:50:00
Subject: Offer follow-up Marencoat DB 1303 roof coating

Dear Mr Coelho,

I am writing to follow up on our offer for Marencoat DB 1303 roof coating. I wanted to check whether you have any questions about the product, its application, or the terms we proposed. Should it help your planning, I am happy to walk you through the technical data sheet or discuss how the material performs on the substrates you typically work with.

Please let me know if anything in the offer needs clarification. I would be glad to arrange a short call at a time that suits you.

Kind regards
Marie Millet
');
