INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('845e0cc9-a6bb-4a45-b517-902f0f78e798', 'DMS-00000926_CRM-20250624-0055.txt', 'text/plain', '806', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:21:46.237462', 'From: michela.romano@marenthal-chemie.de
To: miguel.fuentes@sanchezpinturas.es
Cc: 
Date: 2025-06-24T16:49:00
Subject: Documents Titanium dioxide, technical grade

Dear Mr Fuentes,

Thank you for your recent enquiry regarding Titanium dioxide, technical grade. Attached you will find the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for this product. Please review the safety data sheet before handling, as it contains the hazard classification, handling precautions and storage recommendations. The technical data sheet lists the typical properties relevant to your coating formulations.

If you would like to discuss the grades available in 25 kg bags or the lead times for your next order, please let me know and I will be happy to arrange a call.

Kind regards
Michela Romano
');
