');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('8d5feb9c-d04a-4043-a383-32243f3e40b5', 'DMS-00000937_CRM-20250702-0057.txt', 'text/plain', '853', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:21:58.464596', 'From: yanlei.xu@marenthal-chemicals.cn
To: lingna.duan@jinhai-auto.cn
Cc: 
Date: 2025-07-02T09:39:00
Subject: Marencoat HL 509 水性木器漆 样品申请

段玲娜女士，您好！

感谢您对Marencoat HL 509水性木器漆的关注与支持。现确认：您申请的该产品样品（5千克装）将于本周内完成发货，样品将采用密封塑料桶包装，确保运输途中性状稳定，预计发货后3个工作日内可送达贵司深圳厂区。随样品将附上最新版安全技术说明书（SDS），供贵司技术及安全部门参考留存。

另外，为便于我方技术团队给出更精准的涂装建议，烦请告知贵司拟应用的木材基材类型及喷涂或刷涂工艺，以便后续跟进测试效果。如有任何疑问，欢迎随时与我联系。

此致
敬礼

徐艳蕾
Marenthal 销售服务部
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('ffeb8471-17d2-4c33-b2b9-048965ecae3c', 'DMS-00000938_CRM-20250702-0058.txt', 'text/plain', '808', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:21:59.860131', 'From: romain.leclerc@marenthal.fr
To: rosa.greco@subalpinamaterie.it
Cc: 
Date: 2025-07-02T10:22:00
Subject: Quality alignment Acrylic acid, technical grade

Dear Ms Greco,

Thank you for your recent discussion with our team. We are pleased to confirm the agreed specification for Acrylic acid, technical grade, which will apply to all future orders for Subalpina Materie plastiche S.r.l. Each delivery will be shipped with a batch certificate, so your quality team can verify conformity upon receipt. The material will continue to be supplied in the established 200 kg drums, and we will keep you informed of any changes to lead times. Should you have any questions about the specification or its use in your polymer applications, please do not hesitate to contact me directly.

Kind regards
Romain Leclerc
');
