INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('185556db-93de-471a-bd44-ac24d0accf4f', 'DMS-00000954_CRM-20250708-0059.txt', 'text/plain', '891', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:22:12.786134', 'From: celine.morel@marenthal.fr
To: m.silva@santos-componentes.com.br
Cc: 
Date: 2025-07-08T12:33:00
Subject: Customer visit Santos Componentes automóveis

Dear Ms Silva,

Thank you very much for the warm welcome during our visit to Santos Componentes automóveis last week. It was a pleasure to see your production site in person and to discuss your current requirements in more detail.

As agreed, I am following up on the open points regarding Acetic acid, technical grade. Could you please confirm whether the 25 kg HDPE drums remain your preferred packaging, or if a switch to IBCs would better suit your handling process? Also, please let us know your expected monthly volume so we can review current lead times, which are currently around three to four weeks from our Marenthal plant.

I look forward to your feedback and to moving this forward together.

Kind regards
Céline Morel
');
