INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('f486218b-5644-4a77-98d5-3969f84234a6', 'DMS-00000956_CRM-20250709-0060.txt', 'text/plain', '814', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:22:16.238112', 'From: christian.klein@marenthal-chemie.de
To: g.bakker@amstel-automotive.nl
Cc: 
Date: 2025-07-09T09:52:00
Subject: Application support Marenwet 206 wetting agent

Dear Mr Bakker,

Thank you for the productive call earlier today. As discussed, please find attached the dosage recommendation for Marenwet 206 wetting agent, covering the suggested concentration range of 0.3–0.5% for your pre-treatment line.

We would be glad to support the pre-trial at your site and can have a technician available within the next two weeks, depending on your preferred date. Could you also confirm whether the trial will run on the aluminium or the steel components, as this may slightly affect the recommended dosage?

A 25 kg sample drum can be dispatched within three working days if required.

Kind regards
Christian Klein
');
