Subject: Sample request Marenclean O 1100 active oxygen cleaner (powder)

Dear Mr Azevedo,

Thank you for your recent request for samples of Marenclean O 1100 active oxygen cleaner (powder). We are pleased to confirm that the samples, each of 25 kg, will be dispatched to you this week. The safety data sheet will be sent to you together with the shipment, so that your team can review the handling and storage requirements before use. Should you have any questions about the application or the dosing for your equipment cleaning processes, please do not hesitate to contact me directly. We look forward to hearing about your results.

Kind regards
Steven Collins
