1. Identification of the substance/mixture and of the company
Safety Data Sheet Marencoat AF 309 acrylic facade paint
Product: Marencoat AF 309 acrylic facade paint
SDS: SDB-10731-US
2. Hazards identification
H: H302 H315 H317 H318 H400 H410
3. Composition / information on ingredients
Water (demineralised) 7732-18-5 231-791-2 25.4–31.1 %
Styrene-acrylate
copolymer dispersion
25767-47-9 25.4–31 %
Calcium carbonate 471-34-1 207-439-9 20.2–24.6 %
Titanium dioxide 13463-67-7 236-675-5 12.4–15.2 %
Talc 14807-96-6 238-877-9 3.9–4.9 %
Propylene glycol 57-55-6 200-338-0 0.8–1.8 %
Zinc oxide 1314-13-2 215-222-5 0.485–1.455 % H410
Polydimethylsiloxane 63148-62-9 0.195–0.585 %
