INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('1cda98bb-4c4f-459a-bf93-a8fa822430de', 'DMS-00000996_CRM-20250721-0065.txt', 'text/plain', '803', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:22:50.509515', 'From: guillaume.mathieu@marenthal.fr
To: pedro.monteiro@paranaensecomercio.com.br
Cc: 
Date: 2025-07-21T16:57:00
Subject: Sample request Marencoat RS 703 anticorrosive primer

Dear Mr Monteiro,

Thank you for your recent request. We are pleased to confirm that the requested samples of Marencoat RS 703 anticorrosive primer, totalling 200 kg, will be dispatched to you this week. The safety data sheet will be sent along with the shipment so that your team can review handling and storage requirements before use. The samples are packed in 25 kg drums, which should make them easy to store and test on arrival. Should you require any further technical information on application or compatibility with your existing systems, please do not hesitate to contact me directly.

Kind regards
Guillaume Mathieu
