INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('55fd9f1c-e4f5-4f9f-b869-73dea732cbc9', 'DMS-00001032_CRM-20250806-0070.txt', 'text/plain', '874', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:23:15.040356', 'From: timo.krause@marenthal-chemie.de
To: cristina.constantinescu@constantintextiles.ro
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-06T14:59:00
Subject: Sample request Marensolv 302 degreasing spirit (solvent blend)

Dear Ms Constantinescu,

Thank you for your interest in Marensolv 302 degreasing spirit (solvent blend). I am pleased to confirm that the requested sample quantity of 20 kg will be dispatched to you this week, packed in a sealed metal canister to ensure safe transport and proper handling. The corresponding safety data sheet will be provided together with the shipment.

Could you also let us know on which type of textile machinery or components you intend to use the degreasing spirit? This will help us advise you on the most suitable application method and dosage.

Should you have any questions in the meantime, please do not hesitate to contact me.

Kind regards
Timo Krause
');
