Subject: Quality alignment Sulfuric acid (96 %), technical grade

Dear Ms Bērziņa,

Thank you for your recent discussions with our team. We are pleased to confirm the specification agreed for Sulfuric acid (96 %), technical grade, which will apply to all upcoming orders from Liepiņš Automotive Components SIA. Each delivery will be accompanied by a batch certificate, so you can verify conformity against your incoming quality checks before the material enters production. Should your process require any adjustment to the agreed parameters, please let us know early so we can review it together with our technical colleagues.

Kind regards
Oliver Noack
