Safety Data Sheet Marencoat AF 333 acrylic facade paint
Product: Marencoat AF 333 peinture de façade acrylique
SDS: SDB-10751-FR
2. Hazards identification
H: H302 H315 H317 H318 H400 H410
3. Composition / information on ingredients
Water (demineralised) 7732-18-5 231-791-2 30–36.7 %
Styrene-acrylate
copolymer dispersion
25767-47-9 20.5–25.1 %
