INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('ad1425ab-c5e2-4772-8d2d-1fbb217645ce', 'DMS-00001077_CRM-20250819-0074.txt', 'text/plain', '808', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:04.009897', 'From: severine.humbert@marenthal.fr
To: sophie.devries@vanleeuwen-hygiene.be
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-19T17:00:00
Subject: Application support Marenclean O 1100 active oxygen cleaner (powder)

Dear Ms de Vries,

Thank you for our conversation earlier. As promised, I have attached our dosage recommendation for Marenclean O 1100 active oxygen cleaner (powder). The document sets out the suggested concentrations for your cleaning processes, so you can review the figures before we begin.

We would be very pleased to support the pre-trial at your site. Please let me know which date suits your team best, and I will arrange for our application engineer to join you on the day. The powder is supplied in 25 kg drums, so we can also confirm stock for the trial quantities on request.

Kind regards
Séverine Humbert
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('6d5e0f12-2404-4a40-9229-55153d4e67ea', 'DMS-00001078_CRM-20250819-0075.txt', 'text/plain', '863', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:05.875752', 'From: karen.cooper@marenthal-chemicals.com
To: c.miller@nicholsindustrial.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-19T17:50:00
Subject: Framework agreement 2026

Dear Mr Miller,

Please find attached the draft for the renewal of our framework agreement for 2026. As in previous years, the document covers the agreed annual volumes and pricing structure for our specialty chemical products supplied to Nichols & Edwards Industrial Systems LLC.

One point worth highlighting: we have adjusted the standard lead time for bulk shipments to 3-4 weeks to reflect current production planning at our Marenthal site. Please let us know if this timeframe works well for your scheduling on your end.

We would appreciate your review and comments at your earliest convenience, ideally before the end of the month, so we can finalize the terms together in good time.

Kind regards
Karen Cooper
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('9cb7e53c-12a2-47db-9733-3ab878e1c90a', 'DMS-00001079_CRM-20250820-0076.txt', 'text/plain', '883', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:06.755452', 'From: lea.faure@marenthal.fr
To: ricardo.xavier@atlanticaplasticos.pt
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-20T13:24:00
Subject: Regulatory status Isophorone diisocyanate, technical grade

Dear Mr Xavier,

Thank you for your recent enquiry about the regulatory status of Isophorone diisocyanate, technical grade. Our product stewardship team is currently preparing a written statement covering the registration position of this substance, and you can expect it to reach you shortly. The statement will address the current status under REACH for the grade supplied to Atlântica Plásticos Lda., so that you have a clear basis for your compliance records.

If you have a specific application or end-use in mind, please let me know, as this may help our team tailor the information to your needs. Should you have any further questions in the meantime, I would be glad to assist.

Kind regards
Léa Faure
');
