INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('92c4312b-90bb-427d-9f3f-5ecd210f446c', 'DMS-00001095_CRM-20250825-0078.txt', 'text/plain', '740', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:26.660021', 'From: didier.dubois@marenthal.fr
To: claudio.rizzo@padana-pulizie.it
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-25T16:15:00
Subject: Quality alignment Marenpaste 237 pigment preparation

Dear Mr Rizzo,

Thank you for your recent exchange on quality alignment. We are pleased to confirm that the specification agreed for Marenpaste 237 pigment preparation is now fixed on our side, and that every delivery will be accompanied by a batch certificate, so your incoming goods inspection can be matched directly against the released values. Should your team need the pigment supplied in the standard 25 kg drums rather than the 200 kg containers, please let us know by the end of next week so we can adjust the production slot accordingly.

Kind regards,
Didier Dubois
');
