INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('91e53852-5b95-4417-9257-0295b696b521', 'DMS-00001100_CRM-20250827-0079.txt', 'text/plain', '852', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:32.173171', 'From: wei.alexander@marenthal-chemicals.com
To: r.jones@diazpaints.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-08-27T08:29:00
Subject: Documents Butyl acetate, technical grade

Dear Mr Jones,

Thank you for your recent inquiry. Please find attached the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for Butyl acetate, technical grade, both in their current version. The safety data sheet covers handling, storage and first-aid measures, while the technical data sheet lists the typical specifications and recommended packaging options, including 200 kg drums and IBC containers. Should your team need a certificate of analysis for a specific batch, please let us know the batch number and we will send it promptly. If you have any questions about the documents or the product''s use in your coating formulations, I would be glad to arrange a call.

Kind regards
Wei Alexander
');
