INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('f6f82d37-9736-4630-a46b-cf11b9ae9b3a', 'DMS-00001124_CRM-20250903-0081.txt', 'text/plain', '826', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:24:58.405738', 'From: thierry.brunet@marenthal.fr
To: juliana.silva@barbosalimpeza.com.br
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-03T15:08:00
Subject: Offer follow-up Marenclean A 207 alkaline industrial cleaner

Dear Ms Silva,

I hope this email finds you well. I wanted to follow up briefly regarding the offer we sent for Marenclean A 207 alkaline industrial cleaner, as I would like to make sure all the details meet your expectations.

Should you have any questions about dosing recommendations, suitability for your specific cleaning application, or our standard 200 kg drum packaging, please do not hesitate to reach out. We can typically arrange delivery within three to four weeks of order confirmation, and I would be happy to discuss any adjustments to quantities or timelines if needed.

Looking forward to your feedback.

Kind regards
Thierry Brunet
');
