To: krzysztof.kaminski@zalewska-materialy.pl
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-04T17:35:00
Subject: Sample request Marencoat AL 603 alkyd enamel

Dear Mr Kamiński,

Thank you for your sample request for Marencoat AL 603 alkyd enamel. We are pleased to confirm that a 50 kg sample will be dispatched to you this week, together with the safety data sheet. The sample will be supplied in sealed 5 kg containers so that you can test the product under your own application conditions. Should you have any questions regarding the substrate or the drying behaviour you intend to test, please do not hesitate to let me know, and I will be glad to arrange technical advice from our application team.

Kind regards
Salvatore Gallo
