INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('3ada1291-d351-4143-af00-59ba74ea4043', 'DMS-00001142_CRM-20250910-0085.txt', 'text/plain', '923', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:25:21.515369', 'From: remi.richard@marenthal.fr
To: mario.fiore@rossi-edilizia.it
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-10T14:25:00
Subject: Sample request Marencoat TG 1400 penetrating primer

Dear Mr Fiore,

Thank you for your recent request. We are pleased to confirm that the samples of Marencoat TG 1400 penetrating primer, totalling 50 kg, will be dispatched to you later this week. The safety data sheet will be sent along with the shipment so that your team can review handling and storage requirements before use.

The product is supplied in 5 kg containers, which should allow your technical staff to run trial applications on several substrates without committing to larger quantities. If you could let us know the substrates you intend to test, we would be happy to recommend the most suitable application method and dilution ratio.

Please do not hesitate to contact me should you have any questions in the meantime.

Kind regards
Rémi Richard
');
