To: giulia.leone@lombardatrattamento.it
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-12T09:32:00
Subject: Documents Marendisp 332 dispersing agent

Dear Ms Leone,

Thank you for your enquiry regarding Marendisp 332 dispersing agent. Please find attached the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet, as requested.

For your reference, Marendisp 332 is supplied in 200 kg drums, and standard lead time from our Marenthal site is approximately 7–10 working days after order confirmation. Should you be evaluating this product for a specific water treatment process, please let me know the operating temperature and pH range you intend to use, so we can confirm suitability and dosage recommendations.

Please do not hesitate to contact me with any further questions.

Kind regards
Christiane Kremer
');
