INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('b422d3ed-fe15-4687-baaf-be52220c0445', 'DMS-00001170_CRM-20250918-0093.txt', 'text/plain', '817', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:25:52.272615', 'From: antje.krueger@marenthal-chemie.de
To: m.novak@vidovic-coatings.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-18T09:30:00
Subject: Offer follow-up Marencoat AF 309 acrylic facade paint

Dear Mr Novak,

I hope this finds you well. I wanted to briefly check in regarding the offer we sent over for Marencoat AF 309 acrylic facade paint, quoted for 600 litres in 15-litre pails. I''m happy to answer any questions you might have, for instance on recommended dry film thickness for the coastal climate conditions in your region, or on the application temperature range.

If the quantities or delivery schedule need adjusting, please let me know and we can revise the offer accordingly. We could have the order ready for dispatch within 10 working days of your confirmation.

Looking forward to hearing from you.

Kind regards
Antje Krüger
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('3553f851-ebb7-4966-997f-f97319d5ffa6', 'DMS-00001171_CRM-20250918-0094.txt', 'text/plain', '611', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:25:53.318811', 'From: fei.cai@marenthal-chemicals.cn
To: taoyong.jiang@xingsheng-auto.cn
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-18T11:54:00
Subject: Marenphos 125 磷化液 法规状态

姜涛勇您好，

感谢您对 Marenphos 125 磷化液的关注。关于该产品的注册状态，我们的产品合规部门正在核实最新的法规信息，并将于近期以书面形式向您说明。在此期间，如您的生产线计划在下一季度投入使用，我们也可以先行确认所需的包装规格与交货周期，以便贵司的排产安排更加从容。

如有任何疑问，欢迎随时与我联系。

此致
