蔡飞
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('f45b37c2-8205-4575-a7da-cdae17f193cc', 'DMS-00001173_CRM-20250919-0095.txt', 'text/plain', '808', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:25:54.308521', 'From: remi.richard@marenthal.fr
To: giuseppe.cattaneo@bernardi-commercio.it
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-19T08:32:00
Subject: Regulatory status Marenclean B 1006 chlorine-based cleaner

Dear Mr Cattaneo,

Thank you for your recent enquiry about Marenclean B 1006 chlorine-based cleaner. Our product stewardship team is currently finalising a written statement on the registration status of this product, and you can expect to receive it shortly. The statement will set out the current position for your market and clarify which applications and packaging formats it covers. Should you need the information before it arrives, please let me know which 25 kg drum or 1,000 litre IBC configuration your team has in mind, and I will check the relevant details with our colleagues straight away.

Kind regards
Rémi Richard
');
