INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('696c906e-103e-4003-b3fc-219bb71679cd', 'DMS-00001175_CRM-20250919-0096.txt', 'text/plain', '998', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:25:56.175516', 'From: alexandru.popescu@marenthal-chemie.de
To: eva.pettersson@andersson-automotive.se
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-19T09:22:00
Subject: Customer visit Andersson & Eriksson Automotive Components AB

Dear Ms Pettersson,

Thank you very much for taking the time to meet with us at Andersson & Eriksson Automotive Components AB last week. It was a pleasure to see your production facility and to discuss your current requirements in more detail.

As agreed during our visit, I would like to summarize the open points regarding Xylene (isomer mixture), technical grade. Could you please confirm whether the planned volume of 20 metric tons per quarter will be supplied in 200-litre drums or via bulk tanker delivery? This will help us finalize the lead time, which we currently estimate at three to four weeks from order confirmation.

Should you have any further questions regarding the specification or application in your coating process, please do not hesitate to contact me.

Kind regards
Alexandru Popescu
');
