INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('4b1a9020-d8ca-42cf-8abd-01fcc6773d79', 'DMS-00001182_CRM-20250919-0097.txt', 'text/plain', '868', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:26:02.241341', 'From: celine.morel@marenthal.fr
To: lotte.mulder@eversequipements.com
Cc: 
Date: 2025-09-19T15:39:00
Subject: Regulatory status Marencoat RS 730 anticorrosive primer

Dear Ms Mulder,

Thank you for your patience regarding your enquiry on the regulatory status of Marencoat RS 730 anticorrosive primer. Our product stewardship team is finalising the written statement confirming the current REACH registration status, and you will receive this documentation within the next three to five business days.

In the meantime, could you please confirm whether the 200-litre drums you ordered will be applied via spray or dip coating at your Genk facility? This will help us ensure the technical data sheet we include matches your intended application method.

We appreciate your understanding and will follow up as soon as the statement is ready.

Kind regards
Céline Morel
');
