Subject: Offer follow-up Marencoat RS 703 anticorrosive primer

Dear Ms Svobodová,

I am writing to follow up on our recent offer for Marencoat RS 703 anticorrosive primer. I wanted to check whether any points remain unclear or whether you need further information to complete your evaluation. In particular, I would be happy to clarify the application parameters or the packaging options, including the available drum sizes, should these be relevant to your production schedule.

