1. Identification of the substance/mixture and of the company
Safety Data Sheet Marenclean R 1402 rust remover
Product: Marenclean R 1402 Rostentferner
SDS: SDB-10703-DE
2. Hazards identification
H: H290 H302 H312 H314 H318 H412
3. Composition / information on ingredients
Water
(demineralised)
7732-18-5 231-791-2 69.9–85.5 %
Phosphoric acid
(75 %)
