Subject: Documents Marenfoam 133 defoamer

Dear Ms Leone,

Thank you for your inquiry regarding Marenfoam 133 defoamer. Please find attached the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for your records.

As a reminder, the product is available in 200 kg drums or 1,000 kg IBCs, and the standard lead time for delivery to Italy is approximately 7 to 10 working days from order confirmation.

If you could let us know the specific application and dosing conditions at your Lombarda facility, we would be glad to confirm whether any adjustments to the recommended dosage are advisable.

Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions.

