INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('9bc40db7-5418-4312-9c04-9f5ca44e4928', 'DMS-00001299_CRM-20251031-0112.txt', 'text/plain', '819', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:28:06.95272', 'From: melanie.rolland@marenthal.fr
To: peter.wafula@highlandmetal.co.ke
Cc: 
Date: 2025-10-31T10:51:00
Subject: Price adjustment Marenclean R 1402 rust remover

Dear Mr Wafula,

Please find attached our revised price offer for Marenclean R 1402 rust remover, which now includes the new volume tiers starting at 50 t. We believe these tiers will give Highland Metal Finishing Ltd (KE) more predictable costs as your order volumes grow, and the offer also reflects our current drum packaging and lead times.

We would be grateful for your feedback by the end of the month so that we can finalise the terms in time for your next scheduled delivery. If it would help, I am happy to walk you through the tier structure or discuss how the product performs in your current rust removal process.

Kind regards
Mélanie Rolland
');
