INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('b43c29de-f11e-49a0-a052-9c5907190996', 'DMS-00001306_CRM-20251104-0113.txt', 'text/plain', '821', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:28:15.205184', 'From: rainer.peters@marenthal-chemie.de
To: willem.bakker@brabantse-automotive.nl
Cc: 
Date: 2025-11-04T08:04:00
Subject: Sample request Phosphoric acid (75 %), technical grade

Dear Mr Bakker,

Thank you for your interest in our products. I am pleased to confirm that the requested samples of Phosphoric acid (75 %), technical grade (10 kg) will be dispatched to you this week, packed in a UN-approved HDPE container to ensure safe transport. The corresponding safety data sheet will be included with the shipment, so no further documentation will be needed on your end for initial handling and storage.

Should you already know the intended application, please let us know, as this will help us advise you on suitable packaging sizes and delivery conditions for a potential follow-up order.

Kind regards
Rainer Peters
');
