INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('c6232ee1-fa6b-4ba0-a4fc-c21788a2da5a', 'DMS-00001381_CRM-20251203-0133.txt', 'text/plain', '867', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:29:20.225366', 'From: christiane.kremer@marenthal-chemie.de
To: v.vlachos@vlachos-industrial.com.cy
Cc: 
Date: 2025-12-03T14:08:00
Subject: Documents Marenclean Z 904 citrus cleaner

Dear Mr Vlachos,

As requested, please find attached the current versions of the safety data sheet and the technical data sheet for Marenclean Z 904 citrus cleaner.

For your planning: the product is available in 20 kg canisters, and based on current stock levels we could arrange dispatch within approximately 5 working days of receiving your order. Should you require it in a different packaging size, such as 200 kg drums, please let us know and we will gladly check availability.

Should you have any questions regarding the application of Marenclean Z 904, particularly dilution rates for your industrial cleaning processes, please do not hesitate to contact me.

Kind regards
Christiane Kremer
');
