Subject: Application support Marencoat AF 333 acrylic facade paint

Dear Mr Cooper,

As discussed, please find attached our dosage recommendation for Marencoat AF 333 acrylic facade paint. The document sets out the recommended application rates and the key points to observe on site, so your team can prepare the surface and equipment accordingly.

We would be glad to support the pre-trial at your site. Once you have had a chance to review the attached recommendation, please let me know a suitable date and whether you would prefer our technical team to attend in person or to join remotely. If useful, we can also confirm delivery of the trial quantity before your chosen date.

Kind regards
Lauren Ramos
');
INSERT INTO corpus_document VALUES ('6fb23c54-2d1e-4e35-9333-79d27c8cb325', 'DMS-00001388_CRM-20251210-0136.txt', 'text/plain', '845', 'other', 'manual', 'Manual upload', '2026-11-09 17:29:26.976306', 'From: ignacio.moreno@marenthal-chemie.de
